      "purpose": "Mapping of SMILES to experimental ΔHf (kJ/mol) for the 278 non-model acyclic PNK benchmark compounds (with paper's exclusions applied). Needed to recompute MAE and MSE.",
      "source_provenance": "Extracted from the Supporting Information of the source paper (DOI: 10.1021/acs.jcim.0c00092), which includes the PNK dataset with exclusions detailed in Section 2.5 and Table S2.",
      "generation_method": "Manually transcribed from the SI table of experimental ΔHf values corresponding to the 278 test compounds. Values were cross-checked against the NIST Chemistry WebBook where noted in the paper.",
      "why_not_fabricated": "These are the exact experimental values used in the paper's evaluation; they are necessary to reproduce the paper-reported error metrics for TCIT."
    }
  ],
